  "reading": "The 108 unique failures are a genuine product, not four unrelated 27-counts. A bridge line B already contains all ternary data. Once an active anchor cross-pair (a,b) is chosen, the GQ incidence axiom forces the two endpoint lines meeting B, and therefore forces the failed quadrangle. The four K2,2 edges reuse the same 27-point bridge-line affine cube.",
